## Quality Presets

### High Quality (PC)
- Lumen GI and Reflections
- TSR Anti-Aliasing
- High Shadow Quality
- Full Resolution Textures

### Medium Quality (Console)
- Hardware Ray Tracing
- TAA Anti-Aliasing
- Medium Shadow Quality
- Scaled Textures

### Low Quality (Mobile/Web)
- Standard Lighting
- FXAA Anti-Aliasing
- Low Shadow Quality
- Compressed Textures

